flowchart LR
    subgraph Need
        N1[Current docs]
        N2[Repo state]
        N3[Run tests]
        N4[Read/write files]
        N5[Search error]
        N6[Browser render]
        N7[Issue tracker]
        N8[Dependency versions]
    end

    subgraph MCP
        M1[fetch / web-search MCP]
        M2[github MCP]
        M3[shell / sandbox MCP]
        M4[filesystem MCP]
        M5[browser MCP playwright]
        M6[package-registry MCP]
        M7[context7 / docs MCP]
    end

    N1 --> M7
    N1 --> M1
    N2 --> M2
    N2 --> M4
    N3 --> M3
    N4 --> M4
    N5 --> M1
    N6 --> M5
    N7 --> M2
    N8 --> M6

    M7 -.fallback.-> M1
    M2 -.fallback.-> M3